Consider these psychological and emotional factors:
- Warm/cool temperature: Reds/oranges/yellows (warm, energetic, passionate) vs blues/greens (cool, calm, professional)
- Mood and atmosphere: Bright colors (joyful, optimistic) vs dark colors (serious, mysterious)
- Brand association: Luxury (gold, black), nature (greens, earth tones), technology (blues, silvers)
- Cultural symbolism: Red (luck, celebration in some cultures), white (purity, peace), black (elegance, power)
- Overall emotional impact: Does the color evoke trust, excitement, serenity, or urgency?
